.TH QUIPU-UNPACK 1 "" quipu "Quipu Manual"
.SH NAME
quipu\-unpack \- Merge a published pack into a local graph
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu unpack\fR [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-\-into\fR] [\fB\-\-expect\-repo\fR] [\fB\-\-head\-sha\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIfile.pendant.db\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Merge a published pack into a local graph
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Store file (default: .bobbin/quipu/quipu.db; configuration may override it)
.TP
\fB\-\-into\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Target store for unpacking
.TP
\fB\-\-expect\-repo\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Expected repository identity in the pack
.TP
\fB\-\-head\-sha\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Expected repository head commit
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIfile.pendant.db\fR>

